# Normalize line endings across platforms: store text files as LF in the repository,
# check them out with each contributor's native endings. Without this, a Windows author
# and a Linux/Mac contributor constantly re-touch each other's line endings and see the
# whole repo as "modified". Set once; harmless if you never leave your own platform.
* text=auto

# Binary files -- never line-ending-normalize these (would corrupt them).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.ico binary
